{
  "appendix":"AB",
  "title":"Purchase Repayment",
  "specification":"ATL105",
  "specificationVersion":"2026-3",
  "applicability":"Logical installment/third-party definition and explicitly documented MasterCard companion fields. Not a blanket network eligibility or wire certification contract.",
  "source":"Appendix AB-1; Appendix I-9/I-10 Table 013, I-39 Table 047, I-41/I-42 Table 049 sub-table 04, I-44 sub-table 07; Appendix K-24/K-25 Table 030",
  "sourceNotes":[
    "Appendix AB defines installment payments submitted by third-party installment providers or payment facilitators. Third-party providers differ from the retailer. Use cases include post-purchase and third-party BNPL.",
    "Table 049 sub-table 04 has ID 04, length 2, values CB Consumer Bill Payment (Visa-only) and IR Purchase Repayment (MasterCard-only). CB must not be relabeled as Visa Purchase Repayment.",
    "MasterCard Purchase Repayment requires Table 013 I and Table 047 Installment Provider name*Merchant name, for example XYZ*A SMALL CO. Table 013 data length is 1; Table 047 allows up to 38 bytes.",
    "Table 049 sub-table 07 has ID 07, length 1 and only listed value Y, indicating the merchant opts to receive advice.",
    "Segment 112 Table 030 has ID 030, length 002, two alphanumeric advice-code bytes. It is currently MasterCard-only and supplied by the authorizer.",
    "With acceptance Y, an authorizer decline because a merchant is not registered for Purchase Repayment returns 22. Without acceptance, advice is not returned; no enrollment conclusion is inferred from a code alone.",
    "Merchants must not retry after advice 03, 21 or 22. MasterCard can introduce new advice codes; unknown structurally valid codes are review-gated, not rejected by a frozen allowlist.",
    "No MCC, amount, installment-count, timing or comprehensive brand eligibility matrix is defined by Appendix AB. Discover third-party installment rules belong to Appendix Z/I and are not replaced by the MasterCard IR profile."
  ],
  "businessRequirements":[
    {"id":"BR-SEG100-APPAB-DEFINITION","title":"Installment repayments are submitted by third-party providers distinct from the retailer or by payment facilitators; includes post-purchase and third-party BNPL.","sourceAnchor":{"specification":"ATL105","version":"2026-3","section":"Appendix AB-1","rule":"purchase-repayment-definition"},"status":"PARTIALLY_COVERED"},
    {"id":"BR-SEG100-APPAB-VALUE-SCOPE","title":"CB is Visa Consumer Bill Payment; IR is MasterCard Purchase Repayment. Do not invent mappings for other brands.","sourceAnchor":{"specification":"ATL105","version":"2026-3","section":"Appendix I-41,I-42","segment":"111","tableId":"049","subTableId":"04","rule":"purchase-repayment-brand-scope"},"status":"PARTIALLY_COVERED"},
    {"id":"BR-SEG100-APPAB-MASTERCARD-INSTALLMENT-INDICATOR","title":"MasterCard Purchase Repayment must submit I in Table 013.","sourceAnchor":{"specification":"ATL105","version":"2026-3","section":"Appendix I-9,I-10,I-42","segment":"111","tableId":"013","rule":"purchase-repayment-mastercard-installment-indicator"},"status":"PARTIALLY_COVERED"},
    {"id":"BR-SEG100-APPAB-MASTERCARD-MERCHANT-NAME","title":"MasterCard repayment descriptor is provider name*retailer name, up to 38 bytes, with evidence for both identities.","sourceAnchor":{"specification":"ATL105","version":"2026-3","section":"Appendix I-39,I-42","segment":"111","tableId":"047","rule":"purchase-repayment-mastercard-merchant-name"},"status":"PARTIALLY_COVERED"},
    {"id":"BR-SEG100-APPAB-ADVICE-CODE","title":"MasterCard opt-in Y gates advice; unregistered repayment decline returns 22. Table 030 has two alphanumeric bytes.","sourceAnchor":{"specification":"ATL105","version":"2026-3","section":"Appendix I-44,Appendix K-24,K-25","segment":"111,112","tableId":"049,030","rule":"purchase-repayment-advice-code-22"},"status":"PARTIALLY_COVERED"},
    {"id":"BR-SEG100-APPAB-NO-RETRY","title":"Do not retry after advice 03, 21 or 22; do not assume other/future codes are retryable.","sourceAnchor":{"specification":"ATL105","version":"2026-3","section":"Appendix K-24,K-25","segment":"112","tableId":"030","rule":"purchase-repayment-no-retry"},"status":"PARTIALLY_COVERED"},
    {"id":"BR-SEG100-APPAB-EXTERNAL-EVIDENCE","title":"Third-party identity, registration, authorizer outcome, actual retry behavior, full messages and AI artifacts require independent external evidence.","sourceAnchor":{"specification":"ATL105","version":"2026-3","section":"Appendix AB-1,Appendix K-25","rule":"purchase-repayment-external-evidence"},"status":"REVIEW_REQUIRED"}
  ],
